> Can you elaborate? It's a waste of time to try and keep level down?

Before you kill Rodney the level of the monsters generated is based on
the average of your current XP level and your current depth.  After you
kill Rodney the level of monsters generated is based on your maximum
depth independent of your XP level.

Avoiding levels (arguably) helps before you have the Amulet but is
irrelevant afterwards.  The time fighting in the Scanctum levels matter.
The time rushing to the top is usually avoiding contact when possible so
it does not matter.  The time on the planes hit points matter.

